  "releaseNotes": "- First version of package:\n- Custom OperationResultModel for result encapsulation.\n- Different authentication possibilities:\n- Connection String;\n- Account Name + Account Key;\n- Default Azure Credential + Account Name.\n- Uploading:\n- Uploading a file to a blob via file stream or provided path with optional metadata.\n- Custom metadata validation provides clear error message in Result Model.\n- Download a file to a local path or as a stream.\n- Container Statistics:\n- of all BLOBs in Container;\n- of BLOBs with prefix in Container.",
